#| "correspond to your custom entry '<i>X-Foo</i>', set the widget's <i>name</"
#| "i> property to '<i>X_Foo</i>'.</p><p><b>Important:</b> The widget will "
#| "edit custom fields with an application name of %2.  To change the "
